cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Knowledge Nexus: The First Integrated DRG Validation Platform Fully Authored by a Physician"
type: software
abstract: "The first integrated DRG validation platform fully authored by a physician. It unites clinical guidelines, coding guidelines, DRG-system analysis, and regulatory law in one connected analytical frame, with utilization and denial management read through a value-based lens. The analysis and every final judgment are the physician's. Artificial intelligence serves in defined supporting roles — research, citation, retrieval-augmented generation over a Zotero library, and maintenance of the codebase and repository by Claude — and takes no part in the final evaluation."
authors:
